# Blind v2 local state. Normative source and empty result instructions stay
# tracked; downloaded assets, crawl workspaces, runtimes, and one-shot outputs
# must never be swept into a commit accidentally.
v2/.assets/
v2/.runtime/
v2/.working/
v2/results/*
!v2/results/README.md
